    "name": "Convert4me",
    "description": "SOULMV PDF → Excel (NestJS).\n\n## Variáveis\n\nImporte `postman/local.postman_environment.json`: **URL** (ex.: `http://localhost:3000`) e **Token** (Bearer Genesys, quando aplicável).\n\n## Converter PDF (upload)\n\n1. Body → **form-data** → **file** (tipo **File**) → selecione o PDF.\n2. Auth → Bearer → `{{Token}}`.\n3. Use **Send and Download** para salvar o `.xlsx`.\n\n## Converter PDF (Genesys)\n\nEnvie **conversationId** e **messageId** no form-data (sem arquivo).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "58844905"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Converter PDF",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{Token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": [],
              "description": "Relatório SOULMV (PDF)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{URL}}/convert",
          "host": ["{{URL}}"],
          "path": ["convert"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
